      "heading": "What is Claude Code?",
      "body": "Anthropic's agentic coding tool that lives in your terminal. It reads your entire codebase, edits files, runs commands, and creates PRs \u2014 all from natural language. Now with Voice Mode, you can literally talk to your terminal.",
